node_modules
.DS_Store
*.log
.claude/

# Tesseract language models. tesseract.js caches its model to the *working
# directory* by default, so running anything that touches OCR from a directory
# other than backend/ silently drops ~5MB of binary wherever you happened to be
# — it has already turned up once inside the bill fixtures directory. Ignored
# repo-wide rather than under backend/ because the cwd is exactly what varies.
# The copy the API actually uses is fetched at build time into
# backend/ocr-langdata/, which is ignored separately.
*.traineddata
